             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the `sase_core::editor::at_reference` module — cursor context [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detection that accepts a bare `@` and path-shaped tokens, plus a pure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]I/O-free grouped menu builder whose inventory is supplied by the caller.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]PyO3 bindings for the reference menu[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]binding[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding: export `at_reference_context` and `at_reference_menu` from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase_core_py` as JSON-dict functions in the style of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`placeholder_completion`, with binding-level tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Editor LSP reference completion[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lsp[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lsp: route `sase lsp` artifact completion through the shared module, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enumerate local path inventory from the client root, and shape items so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]any client filters and orders the two groups correctly.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Completion panel row budget[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]panel_rows[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel_rows: derive the visible-row budget from the panel's real content [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capacity so the highlighted row and the overflow indicator are never [/#D7D7AF]\n